ine-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260620/202606200652421747_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260620/202606200652421747_720.jpg"> </div><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260621/202606210748036013_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260621/202606210748036013_1280.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260621/202606210748036013_1280.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【世界杯战报】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-21/match1869160date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">提前出线！德国2-1科特迪瓦 翁达夫替补绝杀+双响凯西破门</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260621/zhanbao_image_1869160_1781992696_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260621/zhanbao_image_1869160_1781992696_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260621/zhanbao_image_1869160_1781992696_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span>德国2-1击败科特迪瓦。此役战罢，德国两战全胜积6分排名小组榜首，提前一轮确定小组出线，科特迪瓦积3分暂排名小组第二。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-21/match1869167date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">升第一！荷兰5-1大胜瑞典 布罗比双响加克波2射1传邓弗里斯2助</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.66" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260621/zhanbao_image_1869167_1781981581_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.66" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.66" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260621/zhanbao_image_1869167_1781981581_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260621/zhanbao_image_1869167_1781981581_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span>布罗比、加克波双响，荷兰5-1瑞典，暂升小组第一，瑞典暂居第二位。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-21/6a36eac3d64a6native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">马宁傅明执法！厄瓜多尔vs库拉索首发：凯塞多、帕乔、陈达毅出战</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.78" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260621/202606210333413284_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.78" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.78" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260621/202606210333413284_1280.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260621/202606210333413284_1280.jpg"> </div><p><span>北京时间今日上午8:00，世界杯小组赛E组第2轮，厄瓜多尔vs库拉索。赛前双方公布首发阵容。</span><strong>本场比赛由中国裁判马宁担任主裁判，周飞担任助理裁判，傅明担任视频助理裁判（VAR）。这也是</strong><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-17/6a3295f7a58f4native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="0,2"><strong>马宁首次主哨世界杯</strong></a><strong>。</strong></p><p><strong>【世界杯动态】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-21/6a370da382780native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">提前出线！德国晋级美加墨世界杯32强，时隔2届再次晋级淘汰赛！</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260621/202606210608156823.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260621/202606210608156823.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260621/202606210608156823.jpg"> </div><p><span>美加墨世界杯小组赛E组第2轮，德国补时绝杀科特迪瓦，小组赛前两战全胜，提前一轮小组出线！</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-21/6a36bf1f86a57native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">官方：马宁担任英格兰vs加纳第四官员，周飞担任候补助理裁判</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.67" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260609/6a2792f586f90.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.67" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.67" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260609/6a2792f586f90.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260609/6a2792f586f90.jpg"> </div><p><span>FIFA官方公布世界杯小组赛L组第2轮——英格兰vs加纳比赛的裁判安排。本场比赛马宁、周飞将与洪都拉斯裁判组搭档执法，这也是马宁本届世界杯第二次执法。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-21/6a36be0e52661native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">F组积分榜：荷兰大胜登顶，瑞典第二，若突尼斯输日本将提前出局</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-21/6a36e9c4b6d54native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">都不好踢！荷兰若小组第2淘汰赛可能碰巴西，小组第1可能碰摩洛哥</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.71" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260621/202606210258592597.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.71" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.71" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260621/202606210258592597_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260621/202606210258592597_720.jpg"> </div><p><span>今天中午12点，日本将对阵突尼斯。突尼斯对瑞典相互战绩劣势，本场若输日本将提前出局。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-21/6a3712b79a047native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">E组积分榜：德国提前出线，厄瓜多尔不胜将送德国第一&amp;输球被淘汰</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.53" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260621/202606210624276935.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.53" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.53" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260621/202606210624276935.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260621/202606210624276935.jpg"> </div><p><span>小组积分榜上，德国提前一轮出线，如果今天早上8点的比赛厄瓜多尔不能战胜库拉索，德国就将锁定小组第一。而如果厄瓜多尔输给库拉索，厄瓜多尔就将提前一轮被淘汰。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-21/6a3712c24f41dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">励志！翁达夫24岁还在踢德丙 为踢球梦完成了激光切割机职业培训</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260621/6a3710afe0750.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio=